# Attribution

This package has two owners, and each part keeps its own licence.

| Part | Owner | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| The SVG icons in `resources/assets/svg/files/` | <!-- the upstream author(s) of {{humanName}} --> | <!-- the upstream licence --> |
| Everything else: the PHP, configuration, translations, tests and documentation | {{vendor}} | MIT, see [`LICENSE`](LICENSE) |

The MIT licence in `LICENSE` covers ONLY the package code. {{vendor}} packages and redistributes the icons; it did not draw them and claims no authorship of them.

